    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Infused Items",
      "category": "interaction",
      "text": "A reckless scientist carries the following infused items: 2 Acid Flask (Moderate), 2 Alchemist's Fire (Moderate), 1 Bomber's Eye Elixir (Lesser), 3 Elixir of Life (Lesser), and 2 Frost Vial (Moderate). These items last for 24 hours, or until the next time the scientist makes their daily preparations."
